  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">FY24-25 ASEAN English Language Training for Officials 60 In-Country</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This Activity aims to develop the English language capabilities of 48 Officials from Cambodia, Indonesia, Lao PDR, Viet Nam and Timor-Leste. It preparation in-country, followed by&#xa0;a 13 week programme in&#xa0;New Zealand to cement language skills and relationships.
This course will commence in March 2025, delivered by Wellington Uni Professionals.</narrative>
  </description>
